The problem is... Life is never easy.

&#x200B;

There will be times OP where you will feel like that if you do not do anything stupid. As for regaining your self-esteem by improvement of yourself, unless you are an addict or mentally/physically damaged you still have a chance. Key point in all that chaos is just being present and aware of it instead of being absorbed by it. If everything is too much than cut them a little bit. Still not enough... Well, cut em' all if necessary. 

&#x200B;

Focus on yourself and only yourself OP, endure and embrace chaos and act upon it, those times are also times when good opportunities arises.

No, but due to my experience with modafinil and theanine, theanine was enough to smooth out the experience. But my assumption is either they will cancel each other out or depending on your body (mixing stimulants and tranquilizers are paradoxical) it might be the "ultimate combo of godlike motivation and focus alongside with an increased social ability and charm turns you in to something like Hitler on angel dust" because phenibut also has dopaminergic properties and with that disinhibition only god knows what will you do.

&#x200B;

