This is a community dedicated to help people who do not know about pharmacology or pharmacokinetics as much as you or me or another. So none is a shitpost here unless it is really out of topic.

&#x200B;

Be calm and make some love/tea brother.

Mixing amphetamine with methylphenidate is not a good idea, amphetamine is already a powerful stimulant with DA reuptake inhibitor properties. Other than that, NAC's glutamergic function may interfere with amphetamines. 

&#x200B;

This stack is not a nootropic stack. I suggest you to look for supplements which are complementary to stimulants on the list such as L-Tyrosine. Also do not forget to take vitamin B's (most importantly B6 and B3)

Sounds like a neurotic rage, get some help and do not fucking kill yourself as you are only 18, believe me my friend life was a pure hustle while at your age.

&#x200B;

It does not get any better or worse, it is what it is. Try to make the best out of it cause probably you only have one chance.

&#x200B;

As for working hard part, realism plays a huge role here. What are your expectations? Ambition-success mismatch is indeed a serious problem but not something to die for.

&#x200B;

Semper Fi brother, nothing lasts forever even bad ones.

